<% content_for :title, "Ripartire con Dash — GeneraImpresa" %>
<% content_for :description, @project["summary"] %>
<% content_for :landing_nav do %><%= render "brands/genera_impresa/header" %><% end %>

<main class="min-h-screen bg-stone-50 text-slate-950">
  <section class="border-b border-amber-200 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_#fef3c7,_#fafaf9_55%)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-400 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">In elaborazione</span><span class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold">Progetto GeneraImpresa</span></div>
      <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black tracking-[-.05em] sm:text-7xl">Ripartire con Dash</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700"><%= @project["summary"] %></p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><%= link_to "Leggi da dove nasce l’idea →", rails4b_content_path(@project["article_slug"]), class: "gi-dash-button gi-dash-button--primary" %><%= link_to "Metti a fuoco un problema", impegno_path(area: "problems"), class: "gi-dash-button gi-dash-button--accent" %></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr]"><div><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-amber-700">Il primo esperimento</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black">Una lista locale per far incontrare persone e produttori.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600"><%= @project["group_note"] %></p><aside class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700"><strong class="block text-slate-950">Comuni sopra i 20.000 abitanti</strong><span class="mt-2 block"><%= @project["population_rule"] %></span></aside></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-slate-500">Categorie da aprire</h3><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><% @project.fetch("categories").each do |category| %><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-4 font-black"><%= category %></div><% end %></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-amber-700">Prima missione</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black">Dalla lista locale al primo scambio</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate-600">Ogni passaggio ha una propria scheda: la landing resta semplice, mentre il contenuto operativo può crescere senza diventare un muro di testo.</p><ol class="mt-8 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200"><% @project.fetch("steps").each_with_index do |step, index| %><li><%= link_to genera_impresa_project_step_path(@project.fetch("slug"), step.fetch("slug")), class: "group grid gap-4 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] sm:items-center" do %><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-300 font-black"><%= index + 1 %></span><span><strong class="block text-lg"><%= step.fetch("title") %></strong><small class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500"><%= step.fetch("summary") %></small></span><span class="font-black text-amber-700 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span><% end %></li><% end %></ol><p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate-600">Dash serve qui come strumento facoltativo per facilitare alcuni scambi all’interno del gruppo. L’obiettivo è far incontrare bisogni, attività e risorse locali e favorire la circolazione del valore, non vendere un investimento.</p></div></section>
</main>
